<<<
transubstantiation. The pronunciation -sia’shn, which is recognized as an alternative by the OED, is here recommended; see -CIATION.
===
**transubstantiation.** The pronunciation *-sĭā'shn*, which is recognized as an alternative by the OED, is here recommended; see ^^-CIATION^^.
